abstract: >-
  Methods and reproducibility release for the quantized horizon-response
  hypothesis. Includes composite-alternative separation arguments, Gaussian
  design calculations, and archived fixed-conditioning GW250114 replay
  evidence. No HRF detection or exact ln(4) identification is established.
keywords:
  - black hole ringdown
  - GW250114
